ional trade and legislation this  domain may prove to be an excellent  option for you  finally we have operations if you have  knowledge about manufacturing processes  and product distribution then this  domain is the right place for you to  explore however to get into this program  you will also need a bit of mechanical  expertise related to manufacturing  processes  however if you feel that you cannot  select just one mba domain from this  list  don't worry you can pursue two  disciplines of your choice under the mba  program of dual specialization however  you must determine whether or not the p  schools that you have chosen provides  this type of program the third and most  crucial factor on our list is  compensation band although a higher  salary is one of the most positive  outcomes of this post-graduation degree  assessing the trends for your specific  domain is quite essential you can check  the specialization-wise placements  statistics of the b-school that you want  to get into try to list the minimum and  maximum placement packages for your  choice of domain once you have these  stats analyze which job profiles are  amongst the highest range of the  formulated placement package bands  doing this will give you a fair idea of  which job role you should be on the  lookout for in the future and what  skills you'll need to gain from your mba  journey to attain this role  while compensation is not the only  factor to consider it plays a very  pivotal role nonetheless the last factor  is assessing your career goals your  future career goals and aspirations are  also important things to look into  assessing these factors will help you  plan your mba journey for example if you  have dreamed of launching your own  business and have the required capital  support then an mba in entrepreneurship  is the best post graduation program for  you or if you've been working for a  managerial role for a few years and are  now looking for transition towards  leadership position